What s09_policy_show.nexo can do (its policy, line 2):
  read    data/, sales.csv (except data/private/)
  write   output/
  net     api.company.com, *.openai.com
  env     PORT
  shell   no
  c       nothing
  python  nothing
Anything else stops a release build; nexo s09_policy_show.nexo allows it with a warning, except shell commands.
